# Slide 1 – Title

Mutual Fund Analytics

Final Capstone Project

Sai Srikar Thatipamula

Bluestock Data Engineering & Analytics Internship

---

# Slide 2 – Problem Statement & Objectives

Problem Statement

* Mutual fund data is spread across multiple sources.
* Investors need data-driven insights for decision-making.
* Manual analysis is time-consuming and inefficient.

Objectives

* Build an ETL pipeline.
* Perform financial analytics.
* Analyze investor behavior.
* Develop interactive dashboards.

---

# Slide 3 – Data Sources

Datasets Used

* NAV History Dataset
* Investor Transactions Dataset
* Scheme Performance Dataset
* Portfolio Holdings Dataset

Key Information

* NAV values
* Investor transactions
* Fund returns
* Sector allocations

