# Slide 4 – ETL Architecture

ETL Workflow

Raw Data
↓
Validation
↓
Cleaning & Transformation
↓
SQLite Database
↓
Analytics
↓
Dashboard & Reports

Tools Used

* Python
* Pandas
* SQLite
* SQL

